267
00:18:49,844 --> 00:18:51,524
We did this job together.

268
00:18:51,524 --> 00:18:53,604
That means we get to die together.

269
00:18:53,604 --> 00:18:55,844
We're not gonna die with you losers.

270
00:18:55,844 --> 00:18:57,284
We don't give up that easy.

271
00:18:57,284 --> 00:18:58,804
Is that so?

272
00:18:59,684 --> 00:19:03,124
Actually, you still haven't told me where you're hiding that treasure.

273
00:19:03,124 --> 00:19:05,444
Friends don't keep secrets from each other.

274
00:19:05,444 --> 00:19:08,164
I'll save it for you before the fire reaches it.

275
00:19:08,164 --> 00:19:10,324
All you have to do is tell me where it is.

276
00:19:10,964 --> 00:19:13,604
Your life is in danger, and all you care about is treasure?

277
00:19:14,164 --> 00:19:18,644
Well, if you don't want it, then you might as well tell me, right?

278
00:19:20,164 --> 00:19:20,884
Damn it.

279
00:19:20,884 --> 00:19:21,764
You've gone nuts.

280
00:19:22,644 --> 00:19:25,204
I'm just trying to stop another tragedy.

281
00:19:25,204 --> 00:19:28,004
I already saw my ship reduced to charcoal.

282
00:19:28,004 --> 00:19:30,804
It'd be a shame if that happened to your treasure too.

283
00:19:31,684 --> 00:19:33,444
All your hard work and for nothing.

284
00:19:34,324 --> 00:19:35,044
You suck!

285
00:19:35,044 --> 00:19:36,564
Get your own treasure!

286
00:19:36,564 --> 00:19:38,164
All right, you win.

287
00:19:39,364 --> 00:19:40,084
No!

288
00:19:40,084 --> 00:19:41,924
You spent forever collecting that!

289
00:19:41,924 --> 00:19:43,604
What would Sabo think?

290
00:19:43,604 --> 00:19:44,404
Shut up!

291
00:19:44,404 --> 00:19:45,524
Sabo would understand.

292
00:19:46,804 --> 00:19:49,044
The treasure isn't important anymore.

293
00:19:49,044 --> 00:19:51,604
The only thing that matters is getting out of here alive.

294
00:19:51,604 --> 00:20:09,524
Six years.

295
00:20:09,524 --> 00:20:12,884
We've collected treasure for six years and hit it in this tree.

296
00:20:12,884 --> 00:20:13,844
Why, thank you.

297
00:20:16,164 --> 00:20:16,804
Don't cry.

298
00:20:17,364 --> 00:20:18,244
It's okay, Luffy.

299
00:20:18,244 --> 00:20:19,844
This won't be the end.

300
00:20:19,844 --> 00:20:27,604
What are you doing?

301
00:20:27,604 --> 00:20:29,684
I told you where it is, now let us go!

302
00:20:29,684 --> 00:20:30,484
I'm sorry.

303
00:20:30,484 --> 00:20:31,844
I don't think I trust you.

304
00:20:33,204 --> 00:20:35,044
Now then, about that treasure.

305
00:20:35,604 --> 00:20:36,404
Let's go.

306
00:20:36,404 --> 00:20:37,204
You can lead.

307
00:20:37,204 --> 00:20:38,244
You moron.

308
00:20:38,244 --> 00:20:40,004
That won't leave us time to escape.

309
00:20:40,004 --> 00:20:41,444
And I'm not dying here.

310
00:20:41,444 --> 00:20:42,164
Just go.

311
00:20:42,164 --> 00:20:43,204
You've got the damn map.

312
00:20:47,204 --> 00:20:48,404
Listen, kid.

313
00:20:48,404 --> 00:20:50,484
Don't you dare piss me off.

314
00:20:51,364 --> 00:20:54,404
I'm not above stealing from children or murdering them.

315
00:20:54,404 --> 00:20:55,764
I'll have my revenge.

316
00:20:55,764 --> 00:20:59,924
And believe me, those nobles will regret the day they crossed Blue Jam.

317
00:20:59,924 --> 00:21:02,484
And to think you called one of them your brother.

318
00:21:03,124 --> 00:21:07,924
They act like a little money and influence makes them a gift to the rest of the world.

319
00:21:07,924 --> 00:21:10,724
Like it gives them the right to look down on us like we're trash.

320
00:21:11,364 --> 00:21:11,924
Shut up!

321
00:21:11,924 --> 00:21:13,204
Sabo isn't like that!

322
00:21:13,204 --> 00:21:13,844
Take it back!

323
00:21:13,844 --> 00:21:14,964
Yes, he is.

324
00:21:14,964 --> 00:21:15,444
Face it.

325
00:21:17,124 --> 00:21:18,724
Sure, you stayed together.

326
00:21:18,724 --> 00:21:20,964
But he was looking down on you the whole time.

327
00:21:22,404 --> 00:21:22,884
Liar!

328
00:21:23,764 --> 00:21:25,284
His parents are loaded.

329
00:21:25,284 --> 00:21:28,644
He doesn't have any of the problems that you or I deal with.

330
00:21:28,644 --> 00:21:30,804
He used you idiots to get some kicks.

331
00:21:31,764 --> 00:21:33,044
He was just bored.

332
00:21:33,044 --> 00:21:34,724
Then got a taste of real life.

333
00:21:34,724 --> 00:21:36,804
And he ran back home to his rich daddy.

334
00:21:36,804 --> 00:21:37,764
That's enough.

335
00:21:37,764 --> 00:21:39,284
Sabo is our brother.

336
00:21:39,284 --> 00:21:40,164
He's right!

337
00:21:40,164 --> 00:21:41,764
Sabo just wants to be free!

338
00:21:45,604 --> 00:21:46,164
Lucy!

339
00:21:48,724 --> 00:21:51,924
Say goodbye, kid.

340
00:21:55,764 --> 00:21:56,884
Just let me go!

341
00:22:01,204 --> 00:22:02,884
Get the hell away from Luffy!

342
00:22:18,724 --> 00:22:45,524
You screwed up big time, brat!

343
00:22:46,324 --> 00:22:47,204
Go on!

344
00:22:47,204 --> 00:22:49,124
Try that crap again before I kill you!

345
00:22:49,124 --> 00:22:50,804
Get off of me, you scumbag!

346
00:22:52,964 --> 00:22:53,764
Time's up.

347
00:22:53,764 --> 00:22:56,644
Ace, no!

348
00:22:56,644 --> 00:22:58,644
Don't do it!

349
00:22:58,644 --> 00:23:17,284
Even as the fires in Gray Terminal threaten to consume them, Ace and Luffy fight Blue Gem with all their might.

350
